// Retail table, checked by hand: entry 0 -> 0x00A0DA96 ('.'), entry 1 -> 0x00A0DA91 (' '), entry 2 -> 0x00A0DA9B
// (','/default); index bytes for languages 7..0x16: 00 02 02 00 02 01 02 02 02 00 02 02 02 02 02 00, i.e. German 7,
